{
  "name": "148. Deployment routes and credential-stripping pins (route and credential pins)",
  "description": "Azure parallel tools, the deployment-scoped embeddings/images/speech/responses routes (previously reached only through provider/model prefix routing), an [EXPECT-4XX] On Your Data probe, and passthrough rows: bogus client credentials per route must be dropped (a forwarded key would 401 upstream) and never echoed, web_search_20260209, a cold-write then warm-read prompt-cache pair (12a/12b share a pcNonce prefix and must run in order), and extended thinking unary + streaming. Passthrough responses carry no extra_fields, so status plus body is the only observable signal.",
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "148.1 azure gpt-4o deployment parallel_tool_calls=true returns two tool calls (azure tools)",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          },
          {
            "key": "api-key",
            "value": "{{openaiKey}}"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"messages\": [\n    {\n      \"role\": \"user\",\n      \"content\": \"Call get_weather for Paris and get_time for Tokyo. Use both tools.\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"tools\": [\n    {\n      \"type\": \"function\",\n      \"function\": {\n        \"name\": \"get_weather\",\n        \"description\": \"get_weather\",\n        \"parameters\": {\n          \"type\": \"object\",\n          \"properties\": {\n            \"city\": {\n              \"type\": \"string\"\n            }\n          },\n          \"required\": [\n            \"city\"\n          ]\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"type\": \"function\",\n      \"function\": {\n        \"name\": \"get_time\",\n        \"description\": \"get_time\",\n        \"parameters\": {\n          \"type\": \"object\",\n          \"properties\": {\n            \"city\": {\n              \"type\": \"string\"\n            }\n          },\n          \"required\": [\n            \"city\"\n          ]\n        }\n      }\n    }\n  ],\n  \"tool_choice\": \"required\",\n  \"parallel_tool_calls\": true,\n  \"max_tokens\": 128\n}"
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/openai/openai/deployments/{{azureDeployment}}/chat/completions?api-version={{azureApiVersion}}",
          "host": [
            "{{baseUrl}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "openai",
            "openai",
            "deployments",
            "{{azureDeployment}}",
            "chat",
            "completions?api-version={{azureApiVersion}}"
          ]
        }
      },
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "var j = pm.response.json();",
              "var tc = (j.choices && j.choices[0] && j.choices[0].message && j.choices[0].message.tool_calls) || [];",
              "pm.test('azure returned both parallel tool calls', function () { pm.expect(tc.length, pm.response.text()).to.be.at.least(2); });"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
